If confirmed by the Senate, Kevin Warsh would replace Jay Powell, whose term as Fed chairman expires in May.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/business/dealbook/warsh-fed-trump.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 03:53:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>